ai "Speed Rusher"
about "Wins the edge with speed and a spin; can lose contain against the run."
position DL
dials aggression 0.75 discipline 0.35 vision 0.5

rules:
  when engaged and time over 1.2s -> spin move
  when before the throw and not they run -> speed rush
  when enemy has the ball and carrier within 2 -> go for the strip
  otherwise -> follow assignment
